[65.503872, "o", "\u001b[1;36m11\u001b[0m-\u001b[1;36m04\u001b[0m \u001b[1;92m21:50\u001b[0m \u001b[32msent\u001b[0m         api.meta.ai      forge.stats.bridge            \u001b[1;36m4159\u001b[0m B  \r\n"]
[65.505006, "o", "{\"messages\": [{\"content\": \"You write a reader for a text metrics endpoint of a running service, as two Python regular \r\nexpressions.\\n\\n1. `line`: matches one whole line (it is applied with fullmatch to the stripped line) and has exactly \r\ntwo named\\n   groups, `name` (the metric's full name) and `value` (its number, integer or decimal).\\n2. `entity` (or \r\nnull): applied with fullmatch to a `name`, with exactly two named groups: `entity`, the thing\\n   measured (an upstream,\r\na cluster, a pool, a queue), and `metric`, what is measured about it. Use null when\\n   names carry no such \r\npart.\\n\\nRead every line whose value is ONE number at its end. Lines of another shape (histograms such as\\n`name: \r\nP0(0,0) P50(1,2)`, lists) may be left unread: do not bend the patterns to fit them.\\n\\nRead ANY value: the numbers below\r\nare a sample and will change. Never list values or names you happen to see;\\nanchor on the structure of a line. Keep \r\nboth patterns simple: no backreferences, no nested quantifiers such as\\n`(a+)+`, at most 300 characters each.\\n\\nFor \r\nillustration only, a reader for a different format whose lines look like `pool.web.active_connections = \r\n12`:\\n\\n```\\nLINE: (?P<name>[a-z0-9_.]+) = (?P<value>\\\\d+(\\\\.\\\\d+)?)\\nENTITY: \r\npool\\\\.(?P<entity>[a-z0-9_-]+)\\\\.(?P<metric>[a-z0-9_]+)\\n```\\n\\nAnswer with exactly one such fenced block and nothing \r\nelse: a `LINE:` line and an `ENTITY:` line (write\\n`ENTITY: none` when names carry no entity). The patterns are raw \r\ntext, not JSON: write each backslash once.\\n\\n\\n\\nLines from the endpoint (a service's text metrics \r\nendpoint):\\ncluster.teamboard_upstream.circuit_breakers.default.rq_pending_open: \r\n33948\\ncluster.teamboard_upstream.external.upstream_rq_200: \r\n38110\\ncluster.teamboard_upstream.lb_zone_routing_all_directly: 89818\\ncluster.teamboard_upstream.membership_healthy: \r\n89663\\ncluster.teamboard_upstream.upstream_cx_http1_total: 24343\\ncluster.teamboard_upstream.upstream_cx_http3_total: \r\n85460\\ncluster.teamboard_upstream.upstream_cx_rx_bytes_total: \r\n30219\\ncluster.teamboard_upstream.upstream_rq_max_duration_reached: \r\n87318\\ncluster.teamboard_upstream.upstream_rq_timeout: 19288\\ncluster_manager.cluster_added: \r\n29512\\ncluster_manager.cluster_updated: 84011\\nfilesystem.write_completed: 96209\\nfilesystem.write_total_buffered: \r\n24559\\nhttp.admin.downstream_cx_destroy_remote: 17067\\nhttp.admin.downstream_cx_http3_active: \r\n9283\\nhttp.admin.downstream_cx_idle_timeout: 69640\\nhttp.ingress_http.downstream_cx_idle_timeout: \r\n28037\\nhttp.ingress_http.downstream_cx_tx_bytes_buffered: \r\n97608\\nhttp.ingress_http.rq_reset_after_downstream_response_started: \r\n38621\\nlistener.0.0.0.0_10000.worker_11.downstream_cx_total: 3928\\nlistener.0.0.0.0_10000.worker_6.downstream_cx_active:\r\n56568\\nlistener.0.0.0.0_10000.worker_8.downstream_cx_total: \r\n16553\\nlistener.admin.downstream_cx_transport_socket_connect_timeout: \r\n89674\\nlistener.admin.http.admin.downstream_rq_4xx: 79744\\nruntime.num_keys: \r\n1891\\nserver.days_until_first_cert_expiring: 36154\\nserver.worker_1.watchdog_miss: \r\n19229\\nserver.worker_11.watchdog_miss: 11134\\nserver.worker_12.watchdog_miss: 34399\\nserver.worker_13.watchdog_miss: \r\n59122\\nserver.worker_4.watchdog_mega_miss: 97615\\nserver.worker_6.watchdog_mega_miss: \r\n57247\\nserver.worker_6.watchdog_miss: 18285\\nserver.worker_9.watchdog_mega_miss: 33647\\nserver.worker_9.watchdog_miss: \r\n46627\\nthread_local_cluster_manager.worker_2.clusters_inflated: \r\n30674\\nthread_local_cluster_manager.worker_3.clusters_inflated: 63803\\nworkers.watchdog_miss: \r\n98959\\ncluster.teamboard_upstream.external.upstream_rq_time: P0(0,0) P25(1.0092105263157896,0) \r\nP50(1.0394736842105263,1.01875) P75(1.069736842105263,1.0625) P90(1.0878947368421052,1.08875) \r\nP95(1.0939473684210526,1.0975) P99(1.0987894736842105,111.59999999999998) P99.5(1.0993947368421053,115.8) \r\nP99.9(1.099878947368421,119.15999999999998) \r\nP100(1.1,120.00000000000001)\\nlistener.admin.connections_accepted_per_socket_event: P0(1,1) P25(1.025,1.025) \r\nP50(1.05,1.05) P75(1.075,1.075) P90(1.09,1.09) P95(1.095,1.095) P99(1.099,1."]
